# MangWalo — client configuration template.
#
#   cp .env.example .env      then fill in the values below.
#
# .env is gitignored. ONLY public, client-safe values belong in this file:
# a Flutter web build ships them inside main.dart.js, readable by anyone.
# They are safe because Row Level Security, not secrecy, guards the data.
#
# Find both in Supabase → Settings → API (use the *publishable* key,
# not the legacy anon JWT and never the secret / service_role key).
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_YOUR_KEY

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER put these in this file, in any Dart source, or in the web build:
#
#   service_role key / sb_secret_…   full database access, bypasses RLS
#   OPENAI_API_KEY                   billed per call (photo search, Phase C)
#
# It lives only as a server-side Edge Function secret:
#   npx supabase secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY=...
#
# The one-off sample seeding script reads the service_role key from your
# shell environment; export it for that command only, never persist it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
